!include ../../../estilos/base.puml.inc
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
title DIA-POS-082 — Ciclo de evento de defensa
hide empty description
state "PROGRAMADA" as s0
state "EN_CURSO" as s1
state "FINALIZADA" as s2
state "SUSPENDIDA" as s3
state "CANCELADA" as s4
[*] --> s0 : T01 programar_evento\n[G01] / A01
s0 --> s1 : T02 iniciar_evento\n[G02] / A02
s1 --> s2 : T03 finalizar_evento\n[G03] / A03
s0 --> s3 : T04 suspender_evento\n[G04] / A04
s1 --> s3 : T05 suspender_evento\n[G05] / A05
s0 --> s4 : T06 cancelar_evento\n[G06] / A06
s1 --> s4 : T07 cancelar_evento\n[G07] / A07
s3 --> s4 : T08 cancelar_evento\n[G08] / A08
s0 --> s0 : T09 reprogramar_evento\n[G09] / A09
s3 --> s0 : T10 reprogramar_evento\n[G10] / A10
legend bottom
Txx: contrato completo en la ficha.
Gxx = guarda de Txx; Axx = acción de Txx.
Son alias documentales, no variables del código.
No se infieren transiciones a partir de choices.
endlegend
footer 689eeb56ac6f / desarrollo / trabajo local / 2026-11-02
@enduml
